BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:spetses-agioi-pantes-above-agia-marina-feast-of-agioi-pantes-monaste-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270626
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270628
SUMMARY:Feast of Agioi Pantes Monastery (All Saints Sunday)
LOCATION:Agioi Pantes (above Agia Marina)\, Spetses\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The women's monastery of Agioi Pantes\, 1.5 km up a cypress avenue from Agios Eleftherios with a view over Agia Marina bay\, keeps All Saints Sunday (the Sunday after Pentecost) with a vigil and a liturgy\, after which the nuns serve coffee and sweets in the courtyard. Early June\, before the crowds\; walk up in the morning.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agioi-pantes-above-agia-marina-feast-of-agioi-pantes-monaste
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agioi-pantes-above-agia-marina-feast-of-agioi-pantes-monaste
END:VEVENT
