BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:spetses-agia-marina-feast-of-agia-marina-agia-marina-beach-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270716
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Feast of Agia Marina\, Agia Marina beach
LOCATION:Agia Marina\, Spetses\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The chapel above Agia Marina beach\, a 20-minute walk east of the Old Harbour\, keeps 17 July with vespers on the eve and a liturgy on the day\, and the beach bars below take the overflow. Small and mostly for the locals\; combine it with a swim.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agia-marina-feast-of-agia-marina-agia-marina-beach
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agia-marina-feast-of-agia-marina-agia-marina-beach
END:VEVENT
