BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:spetses-agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-agia-paraskevi-bea-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270725
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Agia Paraskevi beach
LOCATION:Agia Paraskevi\, Spetses\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The pine-fringed bay of Agia Paraskevi on the west coast has a small church of the saint\, and on the night of 25-26 July the island's summer panigiri is held there with food\, live music and dancing until the early hours. No cars on Spetses: go by the round-the-island boat\, a rented scooter or a horse-carriage\, and arrange the return in advance.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-agia-paraskevi-bea
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/spetses/#agia-paraskevi-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-agia-paraskevi-bea
END:VEVENT
